  "reviews": {
    "summary": "100% recommend (6 reviews)\nLiz Mahy  recommends JWH Decorating & Property Maintenance.\n\nJohn is so professional, does such a great job and a really amiable guy. Still can’t work out how he gets such a perfect finish on the woodwork even though he’s given me some great tips! Thanks John.",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "John is so professional, does such a great job and a really amiable guy. Still can’t work out how he gets such a perfect finish on the woodwork even though he’s given me some great tips! Thanks John.",
        "author": "Liz Mahy",
        "recommends": true,
        "headline": "Liz Mahy recommends JWH Decorating & Property Maintenance."
      }
    ]
  },
  "posts": [
    {
      "text": "I am looking for 2 experianced decorators to join our current team of 6.\nIt is my personal job to make your working life as easy as possible, whilst being on the tools where necessary. I am at your beck and call for anything you may need to make your working day easier. We work with Festool lighting, have an abundance of Festool sanders ready to use, and spray machines for potential training.\nOwn transport essential. This doesn't mean you need a car/van but must be able to get anywhere on the island for 0720 in the morning, 10 minutes before we start work at 0730.\nPlease get in touch if this is of interest to you.\nThanks\nJohn See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Location, location, location",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Experienced decorator?! Tired of your job and the way things are going?\nI am looking for decorators to join our team.\nI think JWH is a well run business, it is my personal job to make your working life as easy as possible. We have gained a good reputation over the years, and from this are offered some fancy jobs to work on. Not all fancy, but work is work.\nIf you are a decorator who knows what they're doing with a good amount of knowledge tucked in their belt, then please get in touch.\nMany thanks\nJohn See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Experienced decorator?! Tired of your job and the way things are going?\nI think JWH is a well run business, it is my personal job to make your working life as easy as possible. We have gained a good reputation over the years, and from this are offered some fancy jobs to work on. Not all fancy, but work is work.\nIf you are a decorator who knows what they're doing with a good amount of knowledge tucked in their belt, then please get in touch.\nMany thanks\nJohn See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Well this was a nice email to receive. All the hard work feels that bit more worth it with comments such as these.",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I've been eager to decorate this building since I first laid eyes on it looking rather neglected, many years ago on arrival to the island.\nI'm delighted to say we are now fully in, transforming the property to a state of excellence.\n\"Taking pride in EVERY job!\"\nEdit...\n1st stage now complete, and is looking stunning. Now time to add some colour and wallpaper. See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A good one to add to our portfolio. A challenging job but the outcome looks great!\n\nWe're thrilled to announce the completion of a stunning renovation project at Moores Hotel!\nIt was a pleasure to work with Sarnia Hotels Group again to revitalise this beautiful space, giving the entrance, reception, restrooms, and the long-unused Jack’s Bar a fresh new look.\nJack’s Bar now boasts an inviting ambience perfect for relaxing with a drink.\n Cheers!\nThis transformation wouldn't have been possible without a dedicated team of consultants and craftspeople. A huge thank you to everyone involved:\nRihoy & Son\nStudio Hilton\nHenderson Green\nDavies Associates\nAC Heating\nStyle Plumbing & Heating Ltd\nSensible Technology\nQuantum Cabling Installations\nResolutionIT\nCheckOut CI Limited\nSmith Signs Ltd.\nNormandie Health & Safety Ltd\nOfficepoint (Guernsey) Ltd\nGFF Guernsey\nG4S\nStainless Steel Fabrications Limited\nSwan Joinery\nJWH Decorating & Property Maintenance\nServaclean\nBathroom Emporium Limited\nTimber & Damp Proofing Ltd\nInteriorsystems ltd\nCapelles Building Stores\nGranite Le Pelley - Guernsey\nChannel Welders\nRob Morellec Upholstery\nFiresafe\nAccess Scaffolding\nBar Fittings\nTwo Degrees North\nSarah Froome Photography\nJ B Parker's Bar & Cellar\n#DesignInspireBuild See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k9",
        "k10",
        "k11",
        "k12",
        "k13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You can find us in the Guernsey Press this week advertising for vacancies within the business. Soon to be advertising on the radio aswel.\nI am being offered so much work in so many different sectors, it would be helpful to have some extra hands on top of our current 6 decorators to be able to take these jobs on.\nIf you're a good decorator with a good work ethic, you will be looked after at JWH Decorating.\nWe have some prestigious jobs lined up, with this year practically fully booked. More enquires are already coming in for next year.\nWe take pride in EVERY job, and haven't missed a deadline to date.\nContact John on....\n07911747461\nJwhutch87@gmail.com See less",
      "date": "",
      "permalink": null,
      "hasVideo": false,
      "imageKeys": [
        "k14"
      ]
    }
  ],
